{
  "info": {
    "name": "RuralB2B Cart-Order API (Stage 6)",
    "_postman_id": "ruralb2b-cart-order-stage-6",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk fitur Tahap 6: Cart, Checkout, Pesanan (Pembeli & Penjual), Pembayaran, dan Bukti Pembayaran. Semua endpoint sesuai implementasi aktual di backend/routes/cart.py, backend/routes/orders.py, backend/services/cart_service.py, backend/services/order_service.py, backend/services/payment_service.py, dan backend/services/payment_proof_storage_service.py.\n\nPrasyarat sebelum menjalankan:\n1. Jalankan backend Flask (python app.py) dan pastikan /api/health mengembalikan 200.\n2. Dapatkan token pembeli dan penjual melalui login (koleksi Auth Stage 1-5) atau register terlebih dahulu.\n3. Simpan access_token ke collection variable buyer_token dan seller_token.\n4. Beberapa request memerlukan order_id dan cart_item_id yang didapat dari response request sebelumnya.\n5. Jangan mengubah atau menghapus data pengujian lama.\n\nCatatan: ID dan data pengujian tidak diasumsikan sudah tersedia. Setiap request yang memerlukan order_id atau cart_item_id menandanya dalam deskripsi dan test script.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/cart - Lihat keranjang",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{buyer_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart"]
            },
            "description": "Mengembalikan keranjang belanja aktif pembeli yang login.\nPrasyarat: buyer_token sudah diisi."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is valid JSON\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.jsonBody();",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has success true\", function () {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/cart/items - Tambah item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{buyer_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": 1,\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/items",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart", "items"]
            },
            "description": "Menambahkan produk ke keranjang aktif.\nPrasyarat: buyer_token sudah diisi. Ganti product_id dengan ID produk yang valid.\nProduk milik profil pembeli sendiri akan ditolak (self_purchase_not_allowed)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is valid JSON\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.jsonBody();",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has success true\", function () {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Saves cart_item_id if created\", function () {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.data && json.data.cart && json.data.cart.items && json.data.cart.items.length > 0) {",
                  "    var lastItem = json.data.cart.items[json.data.cart.items.length - 1];",
                  "    if (lastItem && lastItem.id) {",
                  "      pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cart_item_id\", lastItem.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /api/cart/items/{item_id} - Ubah jumlah",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{buyer_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/cart/items/{{cart_item_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["cart", "items", "{{cart_item_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Mengubah jumlah item keranjang tertentu.\nPrasyarat: buyer_token dan cart_item_id sudah diisi (didapat dari response POST /cart/items atau GET /cart).\nProduk milik profil pembeli sendiri akan ditolak (self_purchase_not_allowed)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
